{"4346310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sylva's Spirit", "steam_appid": 4346310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened from the depths of the forest, a Spirit reclaims its forgotten role as protector. In this dynamic isometric hack and slash dungeon crawler, master the powers of Fire, Water, and Nature to battle hordes of elemental creatures and cleanse a corrupted sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between three elemental affinities to exploit enemy weaknesses, combine your abilities to unleash devastating synergies, and adapt your playstyle to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore infested areas, face unique bosses, unlock new abilities, and strengthen your Spirit through an evolving progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, strategic elemental combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill progression and power upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and bosses with varied mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystical atmosphere with an immersive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and optional challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you restore balance… or will corruption consume the forest forever?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened from the depths of the forest, a Spirit reclaims its forgotten role as protector. In this dynamic isometric hack and slash dungeon crawler, master the powers of Fire, Water, and Nature to battle hordes of elemental creatures and cleanse a corrupted sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between three elemental affinities to exploit enemy weaknesses, combine your abilities to unleash devastating synergies, and adapt your playstyle to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore infested areas, face unique bosses, unlock new abilities, and strengthen your Spirit through an evolving progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, strategic elemental combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill progression and power upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and bosses with varied mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mystical atmosphere with an immersive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths and optional challenges</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you restore balance… or will corruption consume the forest forever?</p>", "short_description": "Awakened from the depths of the forest, a Spirit resumes its role as a forgotten guardian. In this isometric dungeon crawler hack &amp; slash, master the powers of Fire, Water, and Nature to push back elemental creatures and save this corrupted sanctuary.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346310/d0f37f09e666dfb547eed3e651f62e003e0d94dc/header.jpg?t=1773236315", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346310/451a11d094a77619f4e0c81cd1bf40f5fd4585f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773236315", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346310/451a11d094a77619f4e0c81cd1bf40f5fd4585f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773236315", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-2500K or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 760 (4GB) or Radeon HD 7950 (3GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Suppo